     "content_html": "The <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">if</code> and <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">if-elif</code> statements are not chained. The first <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">if</code> evaluates to <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">True</code> and executes. Then the <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">if-elif</code> is evaluated and the <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">elif</code> branch executes."
